Every color is a variable, so the dark scheme only replaces the variables.
@<Project@/litar@/Web@/style rules@+
:root {
  color-scheme: light dark;
  --bg: #ffffff; --panel: #f6f7f9; --raised: #ffffff; --code: #f8f9fb; --fg: #1c2024; --muted: #68717d; --line: #e1e4e8;
  --accent: #4f46e5; --accent-bg: #eef0fe; --label: #92400e; --label-bg: #fef3c7; --item: #166534; --item-bg: #dcfce7;
  --filter: #86198f; --filter-bg: #fae8ff; --danger: #b91c1c; --side: 300px;
  --mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --bg: #0f1115; --panel: #161920; --raised: #1b1f27; --code: #12151b; --fg: #e4e7ec; --muted: #8b95a3; --line: #2a2f3a;
    --accent: #a5b4fc; --accent-bg: #252a4a; --label: #fcd34d; --label-bg: #3b2f12; --item: #86efac; --item-bg: #143222;
    --filter: #f0abfc; --filter-bg: #3a1840; --danger: #fca5a5;
  }
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html, body { height: 100%; }
body { margin: 0; font: 14px/1.5 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; color: var(--fg); background: var(--bg);
  display: grid; grid-template: auto minmax(0, 1fr) / var(--side) minmax(0, 1fr); }
a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
a[href]:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
button, input, select, textarea { font: inherit; color: inherit; }
button { border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--raised); border-radius: 6px; padding: 3px 10px; cursor: pointer; }
button:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
button.primary { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--bg); }
button.danger { color: var(--danger); }
input, select, textarea { border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--raised); border-radius: 6px; padding: 4px 8px; min-width: 0; }
textarea { width: 100%; font: 13px/1.5 var(--mono); tab-size: 4; resize: vertical; }
:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 1px; }
.note { color: var(--muted); }
.error { color: var(--danger); }

@

The bar wraps instead of overflowing, and the content column has a readable maximum width.
@<Project@/litar@/Web@/style rules@+
#bar { grid-column: 1 / -1; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; align-items: center; padding: 8px 12px;
  background: var(--panel); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
#brand { font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; color: var(--fg); }
#bar select { max-width: 24ch; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
#search { flex: 1 1 160px; display: flex; }
#search input { width: 100%; max-width: 420px; }
#pages { display: flex; gap: 4px; }
